    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:see-also:0009:0001",
      "source": "Indicates that the [`AVExternalSyncDevice`](avexternalsyncdevice.md) object is running and that the clock property on [`AVExternalSyncDevice`](avexternalsyncdevice.md) is calibrated to the external sync signal.",
      "ko": "[`AVExternalSyncDevice`](avexternalsyncdevice.md) 객체가 실행 중이며, [`AVExternalSyncDevice`](avexternalsyncdevice.md)의 clock 속성이 외부 동기화 신호에 맞춰 보정되었음을 나타냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f09cbc02646070998304a95abe50ccf937bac1628c65dcc123ebf4b4b76fd577",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
